Maintainer: peterzen <peter@froggle.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: froggle-qubes-split-ssh
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: qubes-core-agent-qrexec
Description: split SSH agent for Qubes AppVMs over qrexec
 Lets ssh, scp, git and other SSH agent clients in a Qubes AppVM use keys
 held by ssh-agent in another qube (the vault) via the qubes.SshAgent qrexec
 service. Installs a systemd user socket at
 $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/qubes-split-ssh.sock, enabled for all users, that forwards
 each connection with qrexec-client-vm, and points ssh (IdentityAgent) and
 SSH_AUTH_SOCK at it. Install it in the AppVM's template.
 .
 By default the dom0 policy picks the vault (@default); an AppVM can name one
 in /rw/config/split-ssh-vault. The vault side (qubes.SshAgent service) and
 the dom0 policy are not part of this package.
